            <formatted-text>
              <run fontname="Avenir Next" fontsize="27" bold="true" fontcolor="#24382c">VIRTUOSO  /  The data behind violin difficulty
</run>
              <run fontname="Avenir Next" fontsize="11" fontcolor="#59685c">Bach pilot · Eight movements · Experimental technical-demand index, not a validated difficulty grade</run>
            </formatted-text>
